tring"},"refresh":{"description":"Refresh metadata for source, or all configured Notion sources when source is omitted. Keeps task pins; configured offline sources remain offline. Cannot combine with cursor.","type":"boolean"},"source":{"description":"Optional configured source ID to disambiguate directories.","type":"string"}},"required":[],"type":"object"}},{"description":"Load task roots directly to apply their instructions; no preliminary read is needed. Requires load automatically: do not add them as independent roots unless independently requested. To introduce, summarize or inspect a Skill, use read instead. Copy a supplied ref, or pass task roots together. Use refresh:true only for a requested update; the supplied current or fixed main ref locates the same owner's latest version. Refresh roots with conflicting shared Requires together. Members remain candidates. Loading does not authorize executing a workflow. Notion consumption does not write to Notion.","name":"notion_use","parameters":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"ref":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"items":{"type":"string"},"maxItems":64,"minItems":1,"type":"array"}],"description":"Supplied sr:C/sr:S or skill://<name-or-id>/<main> refs, or exact Notion Skill page URLs for task roots. Requires are included automatically. Prefer returned canonical refs for later actions."},"refresh":{"description":"Explicitly adopt current versions for only these roots after a complete successful load. Existing Requires-only nodes cannot become independent roots through refresh; explicitly use them without refresh first. Accepts the supplied sr:C/sr:S or main ref unchanged, for example {ref:[REF_A,REF_B],refresh:true} for shared roots. Failure keeps the previous selection.","type":"boolean"}},"required":["ref"],"type":"object"}}]},"type":"message_start"},"episode_id":"standing-pilot80-run-1-four-auto-business-pilot80-017","monotonic_ns":"209557110843333","request_id":null,"run_id":"standing-pilot80-run-1-four-